# Merciless Punishment (Q107): an orc fighter of level 12 accepts at Hatos, reports to Parugon,
# and kills Baranka's messenger three times, once for each of Hatos's orders, for the letters to
# the humans, the dark elves and the elves; Hatos takes them and gives the Butcher's Sword, the
# newbie soulshots and the echo crystals; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
